Summary of stages:

Stage :	What happens
ex.c :	Your source code file
Compiler (translator) :	Checks syntax, converts code toward machine-level
Syntax Error? :	If YES → back to source to fix errors. If NO → proceed
ex.obj :	Object file (compiled but not yet linked)
Linker :	Combines your code with library functions (loads them in)
Loader :	Loads the final program into memory
ex.exe :	The executable file
Execute → Output :	Program runs and produces output

